<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Spanish first division</p>
<p>matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Valencia 2 (Enrique Romero 20th minute, Jose Galvez 73rd)</p>
<p>Valladolid 4 (Victor Fernandez 8, Fernando Sanchez 43rd, 70th,</p>
<p>Jose Quevedo 49th). Halftime 1-1. Attendance 45,000.</p>
<p>Sevilla 4 (Rafa Paz 7th pen, 87th, Luis Tevenet 35th, Salva</p>
<p>Ballesta 69th) Athletic Bilbao 2 (Ismael Urzaiz 5th, Julen</p>
<p>Guerrero 80th) 2. 2-1. 46,000.</p>
<p>Logrones 0 Extremadura 0. 15,000.</p>
<p>Zaragoza 1 (Gustavo Poyet 29th) Deportivo Coruna 2 (Aitor</p>
<p>Beguiristain 24th, Rafael Martin Vazquez 68th). 1-1. 22,000.</p>
<p>Real Sociedad 2 (Gheorghe Craioveanu 24th, Inaki Idiakez 81st)</p>
<p>Hercules 1 (Manuel Alfaro 45th pen). 1-1. 21,000.</p>
<p>Espanyol 0 Rayo Vallecano 0. 20,000.</p>
<p>Atletico Madrid 3 (Jose Luis Caminero 26th, Juan Eduardo</p>
<p>Esnaider 74th, 89th pen) Oviedo 0. 1-0. 35,000.</p>
<p>Tenerife 0 Celta Vigo 0. 0-0. 17,000.</p>
<p>Compostela 1 (Lyuboslav Penev 70th) Real Madrid 2 (Davor Suker</p>
<p>22nd, Raul Gonzalez 80th). 0-1. 11,000.</p>
